{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：11:53 2026-10-25 HKT<br/>發佈時間：09:26 2026-10-25 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：09:26 2026-10-25 HKT</p><p>觀塘發生墮物傷人事件。今日（25日）早上7時55分，一名婦人在寶珮苑寶瑛閣對開休憩處晨運，其間她使用休憩處設施，正踏健身單車，未料突然有香蕉從高處墮下，砸中她的頭部。女事主受傷並感頭暈不適，其後清醒由救護車送院治理。警方封鎖休憩處調查，相信涉及高空擲物，交由刑事調查隊跟進。</p><img alt=\"警方封鎖休憩處調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/78ff987516578fe814018d3dcd6c1d2a/2026-10/2_0_26.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0c8852319a0070ee9a45fa8903d96b15/2026-10/1_4_8.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c038e4979a78723347d307c5ebcde6d0/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-25_at_09_01_52_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5d4287b79df3b1a63b170d66644ca24f/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-25_at_09_01_52.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"事發於寶珮苑寶瑛閣對開休憩處。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6f34a10b74b2235893bd49f7ca1c1dd8/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-25_at_09_01_56_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"事發於寶珮苑寶瑛閣對開休憩處。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2931a5b7945d3c4ae6ed5783cadb7d84/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-25_at_09_01_56.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/10ca4849cc575fdc139354a1b9e3a103/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-25_at_09_01_55_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"婦人踩健身單車，被從天而降的香蕉砸中頭受傷。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ddb0c44e179db7fd6a2e1137781174bd/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-25_at_09_01_54.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"地面遺下香蕉碎。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ff793c06a6b8ea1ab24506954dfb90ae/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-25_at_09_01_53_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3f596a41988ab2a92a2ba9172de09205/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-25_at_09_01_53_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/308dc88f995057df06653e0cd19f5d76/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-25_at_09_01_53.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9412027ce3ae2b42304a72043788924b/2